  <!-- EN: Performance Mode -->
  <RimpsycheUsePerformanceModeThought>性能模式</RimpsycheUsePerformanceModeThought>
  <!-- EN: Use performance mod. Mods directly referencing mood thought offset might ignore personality adjustment -->
  <RimpsycheUsePerformanceModeThoughtTooltip>使用性能模式。直接引用心情思緒偏移的mod將忽略個性調整。</RimpsycheUsePerformanceModeThoughtTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Emotionality Mood Influence -->
  <RimpsycheMoodEmotionalityC>情緒對心情的影響</RimpsycheMoodEmotionalityC>
  <!-- EN: How much Emotionality affects a pawn's overall mood. -->
  <RimpsycheMoodEmotionalityCTooltip>情緒對角色總體心情的影響程度。</RimpsycheMoodEmotionalityCTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Optimism Mood Influence -->
