  <!-- EN: Individual Mood Influence -->
  <RimpsycheMoodIndividualC>個體心情影響</RimpsycheMoodIndividualC>
  <!-- EN: How strongly a pawn's personality affects the mood impact of individual thoughts. -->
  <RimpsycheMoodIndividualCTooltip>角色個性對單個思緒的心情影響程度。</RimpsycheMoodIndividualCTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Experimentation -->
  <RimpsycheUseExperimentation>實驗精神</RimpsycheUseExperimentation>
  <!-- EN: Pawns may experiment while crafting or building, either increasing or decreasing an item's quality. -->
  <RimpsycheUseExperimentationTooltip>角色在製造或建造時可能會進行試驗，會提升或者降低品質。</RimpsycheUseExperimentationTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Sense of Progress -->
  <RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgress>進步感</RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgress>
  <!-- EN: Pawns gain a mood boost from progress like earning skill XP, making quality items, or completing research. Ambitious pawns may become frustrated if they go too long without making progress. -->
  <RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgressTooltip>角色會從獲得技能經驗、製作高品質物品或完成研究等進展中獲得心情加成。有雄心的角色如果長時間沒有進展可能會悶悶不樂。</RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgressTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Resilient Spirit -->
  <RimpsycheUseResilientSpirit>堅韌不拔</RimpsycheUseResilientSpirit>
  <!-- EN: Resilient pawns has a chance to resist mentalbreaks and gain renewed resolve buff for three days instead. (Cooldown 60 days) -->
  <RimpsycheUseResilientSpiritTooltip>堅韌不拔的小人有機會抵抗精神崩潰，轉而獲得持續三天的發奮圖強增益。（冷卻時間60天）</RimpsycheUseResilientSpiritTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Hide in Shame -->
  <RimpsycheUseHideInShame>無地自容</RimpsycheUseHideInShame>
  <!-- EN: Modest pawns not dressed according to their ideology (naked for vanilla) will feel ashamed, and can eventually run away in shame from other pawns' prying eyes. -->
  <RimpsycheUseHideInShameTooltip>端莊的小人若如果未按其文化着裝（原版則為裸體）會感到羞愧，並最終可能想躲避他人的眼神而羞愧逃跑。</RimpsycheUseHideInShameTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Tend over Shame -->
  <RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShame>治療優先於羞愧</RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShame>
  <!-- EN: Pawns with health conditions suppress their shame until they are tended. -->
  <RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShameTooltip>有健康狀況的小人會壓制自己的羞愧感，直到得到治療。</RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShameTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Fight-or-flight -->
  <RimpsycheUseFightorFlight>戰鬥或逃跑反應</RimpsycheUseFightorFlight>
  <!-- EN: In combat, fearful pawns may suffer panic attacks, while brave or aggressive pawns may get an adrenaline rush that temporarily boosts stats. -->
  <RimpsycheUseFightorFlightTooltip>戰鬥中，縮頭縮腦的角色可能會遭受恐慌發作，而勇敢或者好鬥的角色可能會腎上腺素激增，暫時提升屬性。</RimpsycheUseFightorFlightTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Non-colonists Fight-or-flight -->
  <RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlight>非殖民者的戰鬥或逃跑反應</RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlight>
  <!-- EN: Non-colonists may experience panic attacks or adrenaline rushes. -->
  <RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlightTooltip>非殖民者可能會經歷恐慌發作或腎上腺素激增。</RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlightTooltip>

